WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
In Emerald Sprawl, turn 1 does not arrive as a recap. It hits like a district pulse, and everyone watching can feel which corner of the city just lost its balance.

2
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
We have a developing situation in Rust Market runners. Old favors came due around a failed gear reconciliation and shoved Debt Heat to the front of the board.

3
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Behind the desk, the next move is already visible. Ashline Circle crews: Track Awakened push as a live board move.

4
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
GM work changes the board here; it does not just annotate it after the fact. The city remembers the crews that move first and the districts that fail to recover.

5
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Tonight the city closes on this reality: Rust Bazaar is the hottest visible district at 77 heat. Rust Bazaar moved the hardest this turn with delta 8. Tomorrow the board opens again, and the next faction that hesitates will be seen.
